    "title": "East Australian Current gridded (depth, distance and time) mooring product",
    "date_created": "2023-11-14T10:04:58Z",
    "date_modified": "2023-11-14T10:04:58Z",
    "abstract": "This daily-, distance- and depth-gridded product of currents, temperature and salinity is produced from the SOM-filled EAC individual mooring data product in the links section of the CSIRO DAP record for this dataset. The data can be used to produce volume and heat transport time series across the entire EAC.",
    "source": "subsurface mooring",
    "history": "Created from IMOS-EAC, IMOS-NSI and IMOS-SEQ site instrument files from deployment periods: 2012/04 to 2013/08; 2012/04 to 2013/08; 2015/05 to 2016/11; 2016/11 to 2018/05; 2018/05 to 2019/09; 2019/09 to 2021/05; 2021/05 to 2022/07; NRSNSI: 2012/04 to 2022/06",
    "keywords": "EARTH SCIENCE >Oceans >Ocean Temperature, EARTH SCIENCE >Oceans >Ocean Circulation >Ocean Currents, EARTH SCIENCE >Oceans >Bathymetry/Seafloor Topography >Water depth, EARTH SCIENCE >Oceans >Salinity/Density >Salinity",
